op", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your parts 6 and 7: forms, surveys, tags, custom fields and missed-call text back. Whether\nthey fill in a form or you miss their call, they land as one contact with a tag saying where\nthey came from.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_26", "type": "rectangle", "x": 796, "y": -134, "width": 1048, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_27", "type": "text", "x": 818, "y": -118, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - FOLLOW-UP THAT KNOWS WHEN TO STOP", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - FOLLOW-UP THAT KNOWS WHEN TO STOP", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_28", "type": "text", "x": 818, "y": -82, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your parts 1, 2 and 8: SMS and email follow-up, the stop rules and the if/else check. Duplicate texts come from two workflows listening to\nthe same trigger, so one workflow owns each lead, and one stop rule covers replies, bookings, opportunities and DND.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your parts 1, 2 and 8: SMS and email follow-up, the stop rules and the if/else check. Duplicate texts come from two workflows listening to\nthe same trigger, so one workflow owns each lead, and one stop rule covers replies, bookings, opportunities and DND.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_29", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2042, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_30", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - BOOKED, REMINDED, MOVED DOWN THE PIPELINE", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - BOOKED, REMINDED, MOVED DOWN THE PIPELINE", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_31", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyl